Senator Joel Villanueva: We have a chairperson in the Senate headed by Senator.

asr-002555
02:06:54.580 --> 02:07:13.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Who is not just fond of railways and transportation initiatives, but very passionate in ensuring that there will be changes, there will be radical changes in our transportation sector.

asr-002556
02:07:13.820 --> 02:07:23.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: So again, Mr. President, I'd like to put on record my full support for the passage and approval of the proposed 2027 budget.

asr-002557
02:07:24.580 --> 02:07:25.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: So again, Mr. President, I'd like to put on record my full support for the passage and approval of the proposed 2027 budget.

asr-002558
