asr-002560
02:07:27.340 --> 02:07:28.240
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-002561
02:07:28.240 --> 02:07:33.900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And before we continue, let me just say a few words on the discussions today.

asr-002562
02:07:34.600 --> 02:07:46.540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: First and foremost, let me commend our Chairman, Senator Javier Cito, for restoring the foreign-assisted projects almost to its fullest amount in the NEP.

asr-002563
02:07:47.120 --> 02:07:53.380
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: This is the highest restoration ever in the last maybe five years.

asr-002564
02:07:53.380 --> 02:08:07.620
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And so far as foreign-assisted projects is concerned, kanina nga napakita ni Senator Panfilo Lacson na almost 100% na hiningi ng agency ay narestore natin.

asr-002565
02:08:08.240 --> 02:08:14.920
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And foreign-assisted projects is important next year because this will deliver long-term growth for our country.

asr-002566
02:08:15.280 --> 02:08:20.400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We're talking about the subway, we're talking about the commuter rails and other transportation projects.

asr-002567
02:08:20.400 --> 02:08:21.400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we commend our Chairman for...

asr-002568
02:08:23.380 --> 02:08:32.900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: for doing everything he can to fully restore the foreign-assisted projects, particularly the GOP counterpart.

asr-002569
02:08:33.360 --> 02:08:40.760
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ano yan eh? Equity natin yung GOP counterpart. Mukha natin yan eh. Kung hindi natin marerestore yan, nakakahiya sa atin as a nation.

asr-002570
02:08:41.380 --> 02:08:44.700
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And secondly, let me also express my support to the...

asr-002571
02:08:44.700 --> 02:08:49.900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to the requests and the call of our Majority Leader.

asr-002572
02:08:52.160 --> 02:08:53.360
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Importante ang tourism.

asr-002573
02:08:53.380 --> 02:08:56.420
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sa atin, we all agree that this is a low-hanging fruit.

asr-002574
02:08:57.640 --> 02:09:01.320
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Napakabilis ma-revive ang tourism industry natin.

asr-002575
02:09:01.460 --> 02:09:03.400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang kailangan lang natin, accessibility.

asr-002576
02:09:04.260 --> 02:09:10.860
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So I was talking to our Majority Leader, and a proposal, Secretary Vincis,

asr-002577
02:09:11.960 --> 02:09:17.980
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ilan lang naman yung ating importanteng tourism sites like Coron, El Nido, Siargao.

asr-002578
02:09:17.980 --> 02:09:20.980
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang my proposal is...

asr-002579
02:09:21.720 --> 02:09:23.360
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mabalik natin itong mga...

asr-002580
02:09:23.380 --> 02:09:26.040
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong mga tourism areas to Metro Manila.

asr-002581
02:09:26.680 --> 02:09:32.760
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong mga areas na may turboprop service tayo to Coron, to El Nido, to Siargao.

asr-002582
02:09:33.720 --> 02:09:39.160
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ito yung mga mahalagang engines of growth ng tourism industry natin.

asr-002583
02:09:39.280 --> 02:09:43.840
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Itong mga lugar, pwede natin ibalik sa Metro Manila, at least for now.

asr-002584
02:09:44.540 --> 02:09:50.540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Until we find a permanent solution for the other flights that were relocated to Clark.

asr-002585
02:09:50.540 --> 02:09:52.540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At itong tatlo, alam ko, ito ang...

asr-002586
02:09:53.380 --> 02:09:57.620
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: One of the most sought-after tourism sites in the world.

asr-002587
02:09:58.140 --> 02:10:02.100
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So ang proposal namin ay mabalik siya sa Metro Manila.

asr-002588
02:10:02.300 --> 02:10:07.040
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Para hindi practical kasi na magbabiyahe ka pa ng two hours to Clark.

asr-002589
02:10:07.520 --> 02:10:11.860
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tapos mag-aantay ka ng one hour dahil ka lang one hour ahead ka.

asr-002590
02:10:12.220 --> 02:10:16.480
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And your flight is only 30 minutes to 45 minutes.

asr-002591
02:10:16.480 --> 02:10:23.000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So all in all, ang experience mo is about three to four hours just one way.

asr-002592
02:10:23.380 --> 02:10:32.220
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we have to be practical also and enhance the experience of our tourists who come here and visit our islands.

asr-002593
02:10:32.980 --> 02:10:39.640
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So once again, I thank our Secretary, Secretary Vince.

asr-002594
02:10:39.800 --> 02:10:42.220
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Akalila naman natin si Secretary Vince. Action man to.

asr-002595
02:10:42.840 --> 02:10:46.900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Taw ko nga dito, Wonder Boy, dahil boy si muka pero matanda na ho yan.

