Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ah...

asr-002600
02:10:52.780 --> 02:10:53.260
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Vaccine.

asr-002601
02:10:53.380 --> 02:10:55.640
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tsar. I remember at testing tsar before.

asr-002602
02:10:56.760 --> 02:11:01.220
