asr-003409
04:15:58.600 --> 04:16:02.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Budget of the Department of Environment and Natural Resources,

asr-003410
04:16:03.380 --> 04:16:04.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Office of the Secretary,

asr-003411
04:16:05.380 --> 04:16:06.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Environment Management Bureau,

asr-003412
04:16:07.500 --> 04:16:08.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mines and Geosciences Bureau,

asr-003413
04:16:09.740 --> 04:16:12.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: National Mapping and Resource Information Authority,

asr-003414
04:16:12.760 --> 04:16:14.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: National Water Resource Board,

asr-003415
04:16:14.920 --> 04:16:16.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Palawan Council for Sustainable Development,

asr-003416
04:16:17.860 --> 04:16:20.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Local Water Utilities Administration,

asr-003417
04:16:21.060 --> 04:16:24.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Metropolitan Works and Sewerage System Regulatory Office,

asr-003418
04:16:25.580 --> 04:16:28.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: are hereby, except for the LLDA, Mr. President,

asr-003419
04:16:28.300 --> 04:16:29.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: that we'll ask to come back tomorrow,

asr-003420
04:16:30.420 --> 04:16:32.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think, to meet with the Minority Floor Leader.

asr-003421
04:16:32.420 --> 04:16:34.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: All the rest are hereby deemed submitted.

asr-003422
04:16:34.340 --> 04:16:35.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I sum up, Mr. President.

asr-003423
04:16:35.120 --> 04:16:37.160
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Any objection? Hearing none.

asr-003424
04:16:37.400 --> 04:16:42.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: The budget of the DNR and the enumerated agencies,

asr-003425
04:16:42.180 --> 04:16:44.700
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: or attached agencies mentioned by the Minority Floor Leader,

asr-003426
04:16:45.020 --> 04:16:46.980
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: is by deemed submitted.

asr-003427
04:16:47.540 --> 04:16:48.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

asr-003428
04:16:49.580 --> 04:16:50.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Congratulations to the sponsor,

asr-003429
04:16:51.020 --> 04:16:54.700
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and congratulations to the good men and women of the DNR.

asr-003430
04:16:55.240 --> 04:16:56.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you po. May I ask for a minute's suspension?

asr-003431
04:16:56.740 --> 04:16:57.900
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Session suspended.

asr-003611
05:42:52.600 --> 05:42:59.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, Mr. President. Mr. President, I'll call out the budgets of two agencies left. And then whoever would like to ask questions on the agencies are

asr-003614
05:42:59.860 --> 05:43:00.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: most welcome.

asr-003615
05:43:01.820 --> 05:43:06.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We'd like to call out or take in consideration the budget of the Games and Amusements Board

asr-003616
05:43:06.900 --> 05:43:09.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: as well as the Philippine Sports Commission

asr-003617
05:43:09.540 --> 05:43:16.960
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and ask the good sponsor, Senator Christopher Bongo, to sponsor both measures.

asr-003618
05:43:17.260 --> 05:43:20.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Give the highlights of the budgets of the two measures.

asr-003619
05:43:20.320 --> 05:43:25.020
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We recognize the sponsor for the Games and Amusements Board

asr-003620
05:43:25.020 --> 05:43:28.340
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: as well as the Philippine Sports Commission, Senator Bongo.

asr-003621
05:43:28.340 --> 05:43:30.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-003622
05:43:30.440 --> 05:43:34.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For fiscal year 2027 for the Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-003623
05:43:35.120 --> 05:43:47.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: in our committee report, the total new appropriations is 1,891,444,000 pesos.

asr-003624
05:43:47.860 --> 05:43:50.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: The increase of 580 million is in our committee report

asr-003625
05:43:50.780 --> 05:43:56.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: is mostly due to the additional funding for hosting of international competitions,

asr-003626
05:43:56.720 --> 05:43:58.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: construction of regional sports,

asr-003627
05:43:58.340 --> 05:44:02.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: football centers, grassroots sports programs, and assistance to athletes.

asr-003628
05:44:04.500 --> 05:44:07.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And for the Games and Amusements Board, in our committee report,

asr-003629
05:44:08.140 --> 05:44:15.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: is 157,230,000 pesos, no increase.

asr-003630
05:44:16.740 --> 05:44:18.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you. Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-003631
05:44:19.000 --> 05:44:21.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President, we'd like to ask, we have two colleagues here.

asr-003632
05:44:21.860 --> 05:44:25.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think they want to propound some questions or manifestations to the agencies.

asr-003633
05:44:25.640 --> 05:44:27.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Should it be ladies first?

asr-003634
05:44:28.340 --> 05:44:29.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Oh, yes, ladies first.

asr-003635
05:44:30.060 --> 05:44:31.300
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Senator Pia Cayetano.

asr-003636
05:44:31.340 --> 05:44:33.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We recognize Senator Pia Cayetano.

asr-003637
05:44:39.240 --> 05:44:41.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Before we recognize Senator Cayetano, Mr. President,

asr-003638
05:44:41.860 --> 05:44:43.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: we'd just like to put on record,

asr-003639
05:44:44.160 --> 05:44:47.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the Philippine Sports Commission Chair, Pato Gregorio,

asr-003640
05:44:47.480 --> 05:44:50.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: had asked to be excused because he's in FIFA today

asr-003641
05:44:50.760 --> 05:44:56.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: trying to get a $25 million sports development, football development initiative

asr-003642
05:44:56.260 --> 05:44:57.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to build a multipurpose...

asr-003643
05:44:58.340 --> 05:45:00.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ...football stadium and...

asr-003644
05:45:00.000 --> 05:45:00.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: as other initiatives.

asr-003645
05:45:02.140 --> 05:45:05.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I said that it's okay as long as he comes back next week on Thursday

asr-003646
05:45:05.620 --> 05:45:11.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: before the budget is approved and ratified on second reading.

asr-003647
05:45:11.560 --> 05:45:13.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So he'll be coming, Mr. President, as told.

asr-003648
05:45:13.880 --> 05:45:14.920
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: He'll be here Thursday morning.

asr-003649
05:45:15.060 --> 05:45:19.880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, I had the opportunity to meet the FIFA president during ASEAN.

asr-003650
05:45:20.000 --> 05:45:20.880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think he was here.

asr-003651
05:45:22.460 --> 05:45:24.140
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pato Gregorio introduced me to them.

asr-003652
05:45:24.140 --> 05:45:27.960
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And yes, FIFA is very interested in investing in the Philippines

asr-003653
05:45:27.960 --> 05:45:32.540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to boost our sports activities here.

asr-003654
05:45:33.380 --> 05:45:34.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. President, if I may.

asr-003655
05:45:35.480 --> 05:45:36.980
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, we recognize Senator Joe.

asr-003656
05:45:37.120 --> 05:45:41.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: This is just a short manifestation with regard to the manifestation

asr-003657
05:45:41.940 --> 05:45:45.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: or statements made by our distinguished majority leader.

asr-003658
05:45:45.740 --> 05:45:47.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: I just want to put on record, Mr. President,

asr-003659
05:45:47.700 --> 05:45:52.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: that since the day I became a member of the legislature,

asr-003660
05:45:53.620 --> 05:45:55.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: not too long ago, Mr. President,

asr-003661
05:45:55.540 --> 05:46:01.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: in the House of Representatives and as a member of this August Chamber

asr-003662
05:46:01.700 --> 05:46:06.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: of this institution, we have yet to deliberate on a budget

asr-003663
05:46:06.460 --> 05:46:12.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: without the head or chair of the agency or the department.

asr-003664
05:46:12.520 --> 05:46:19.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: However, Mr. President, we are aware of the importance of this meeting

asr-003665
05:46:19.220 --> 05:46:21.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: being held right now outside the country.

asr-003666
05:46:21.800 --> 05:46:25.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And we feel that it is important that,

asr-003667
05:46:25.540 --> 05:46:29.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: as the head of FIFA who went here in the Philippines,

asr-003668
05:46:30.900 --> 05:46:34.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: go out of his way to come visit our beloved country.

asr-003669
05:46:34.880 --> 05:46:41.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And so I was told, Mr. President, that the meeting being held outside the country right now

asr-003670
05:46:43.360 --> 05:46:49.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: is a very important meeting where we can actually get an opportunity

asr-003671
05:46:49.060 --> 05:46:52.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: to have a lot of grants and

asr-003672
05:46:52.460 --> 05:46:52.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: the

asr-003673
05:46:55.540 --> 05:47:03.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: details with the FIFA headed, of course, by our Philippine Sports Commission chairperson,

asr-003674
05:47:03.700 --> 05:47:05.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pato Gregorio.

asr-003675
05:47:05.380 --> 05:47:08.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: We post no objection, Mr. President.

asr-003676
05:47:08.780 --> 05:47:13.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: However, we'd like to put on record that this should not be a precedent

asr-003677
05:47:13.220 --> 05:47:20.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: and this should not be emulated by anyone heading the departments or agencies

asr-003678
05:47:20.980 --> 05:47:25.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: because today, Mr. President, no less than the vice president herself,

asr-003679
05:47:25.000 --> 05:47:30.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: came here and showed up during the budget deliberation.

asr-003680
05:47:31.100 --> 05:47:34.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: So that's all, Mr. President, for us to be clear.

asr-003681
05:47:35.500 --> 05:47:36.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

asr-003682
05:47:36.340 --> 05:47:41.900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, it's a time-honored tradition that the head of agency comes to the Senate

asr-003683
05:47:41.900 --> 05:47:45.600
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to defend their own budget, to justify their own budget.

asr-003684
05:47:45.720 --> 05:47:48.060
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's their budget, so they should be the ones to defend it.

asr-003685
05:47:49.640 --> 05:47:53.520
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So this is an exception rather than a rule.

asr-003686
05:47:53.520 --> 05:47:54.920
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And that's why, too,

asr-003687
05:47:55.000 --> 05:48:00.560
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to compensate that exception before the budget gets approved on second reading,

asr-003688
05:48:01.040 --> 05:48:04.000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: they will be requested to come here to the Senate

asr-003689
05:48:04.000 --> 05:48:09.800
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to participate in the discussions.

asr-003690
05:48:10.080 --> 05:48:12.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes, and Mr. President, that's why we're requesting them to come

asr-003691
05:48:12.900 --> 05:48:14.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: before the period of amendments

asr-003692
05:48:14.520 --> 05:48:17.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: because a failure for them to come

asr-003693
05:48:17.000 --> 05:48:20.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: will also, I suggest, that we just move their budget elsewhere

asr-003694
05:48:20.760 --> 05:48:22.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: or we just lessen their budget

asr-003695
05:48:22.400 --> 05:48:24.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and give it to another...

asr-003696
05:48:24.640 --> 05:48:29.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: department who are more willing to defend their budget.

asr-003697
05:48:29.320 --> 05:48:33.480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So their promise naman is to come before the period of amendments.

asr-003698
05:48:33.480 --> 05:48:38.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, forewarned, those agencies that were not here,

asr-003699
05:48:38.360 --> 05:48:39.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the heads of agencies were not here,

asr-003700
05:48:40.180 --> 05:48:41.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: we're forewarning them now

asr-003701
05:48:41.580 --> 05:48:44.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: that there's a chance na mabawasan po yung budget nila

asr-003702
05:48:44.740 --> 05:48:46.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: kung di sila pong sumipot dito.

asr-003703
05:48:46.460 --> 05:48:46.640
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Correct.

asr-003704
05:48:46.840 --> 05:48:49.320
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And like what Senator Joel mentioned,

asr-003705
05:48:49.480 --> 05:48:52.580
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: no less than the vice president of our country came here

asr-003706
05:48:52.580 --> 05:48:54.480
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to defend her budget and to...

asr-003707
05:48:54.640 --> 05:48:58.540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: justify her budget for 2027.

asr-003708
05:48:58.920 --> 05:49:00.940
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we'll make sure

asr-003709
05:49:00.940 --> 05:49:05.420
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: well, the people from the PSC is here

asr-003710
05:49:05.420 --> 05:49:09.760
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: so I'm sure that they will relay the message to Mr. Gregorio.

asr-003711
05:49:10.540 --> 05:49:13.060
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So with that, we recognize Senator Pia Cayetano.

asr-003712
05:49:14.640 --> 05:49:16.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-003713
05:49:16.680 --> 05:49:18.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Good evening to everyone,

asr-003714
05:49:18.040 --> 05:49:22.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Chairman and the entire PSC and GAB family.

asr-003715
05:49:23.320 --> 05:49:24.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't...

asr-003716
05:49:24.640 --> 05:49:25.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: really have any questions.

asr-003717
05:49:26.080 --> 05:49:29.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I will just be manifesting my support and my concerns

asr-003718
05:49:29.060 --> 05:49:30.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for a few areas.

asr-003719
05:49:30.580 --> 05:49:34.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then if there's anyone who wants to relay

asr-003720
05:49:34.760 --> 05:49:36.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: to the chairman a quick response, it's okay.

asr-003721
05:49:37.020 --> 05:49:41.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But basically, it's really my manifestation of support.

asr-003722
05:49:42.080 --> 05:49:44.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So with the permission of the chair, I will proceed.

asr-003723
05:49:45.580 --> 05:49:48.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I want to start with grassroots programs.

asr-003724
05:49:49.840 --> 05:49:53.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: When Filipinos watch our elite athletes succeed,

asr-003725
05:49:54.640 --> 05:49:57.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and obviously, that comes with so much pride and joy,

asr-003726
05:49:58.640 --> 05:50:03.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's true that many don't know the challenges

asr-003727
05:50:03.260 --> 05:50:06.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that these athletes went through to get to that elite level.

asr-003728
05:50:07.260 --> 05:50:09.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But with social media today,

asr-003729
05:50:09.920 --> 05:50:13.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and even AI that comes up with all these interesting

asr-003730
05:50:13.280 --> 05:50:15.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: mini-documentaries,

asr-003731
05:50:16.260 --> 05:50:17.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nagkakaroon na sila ng picture

asr-003732
05:50:17.880 --> 05:50:22.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of how these athletes got to where they are.

asr-003733
05:50:22.160 --> 05:50:24.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And on the good side is they realize

asr-003734
05:50:24.640 --> 05:50:27.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: the Filipinos realize that there's no shortcut.

asr-003735
05:50:27.460 --> 05:50:29.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala namang nakarating ng ganyang level na

asr-003736
05:50:29.300 --> 05:50:34.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: hindi nagbuhos ng pagod, hirap, gumastos.

asr-003737
05:50:36.060 --> 05:50:37.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But at the same time,

asr-003738
05:50:38.420 --> 05:50:40.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it tends to highlight

asr-003739
05:50:40.480 --> 05:50:44.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: areas that we can still work on.

asr-003740
05:50:44.500 --> 05:50:46.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And of course, that revolves around funding.

asr-003741
05:50:47.020 --> 05:50:50.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi a lot of these talents can be...

asr-003742
05:50:50.740 --> 05:50:54.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There are a lot of talents in the provinces.

asr-003743
05:50:54.640 --> 05:50:56.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And the opportunities there are really less.

asr-003744
05:50:57.420 --> 05:50:59.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I speak from experience

asr-003745
05:50:59.300 --> 05:51:03.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because when I was a university athlete,

asr-003746
05:51:03.800 --> 05:51:06.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 40 plus years ago na.

asr-003747
05:51:08.540 --> 05:51:11.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kunti lang yung teammates ko na from the province.

asr-003748
05:51:11.200 --> 05:51:13.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi siguro ganun kahirap makarating.

asr-003749
05:51:13.540 --> 05:51:14.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hindi naman ka naman makatext na.

asr-003750
05:51:15.120 --> 05:51:16.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala kang makitang announcement

asr-003751
05:51:16.820 --> 05:51:18.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kung paano yung tryout sa UP.

asr-003752
05:51:18.620 --> 05:51:20.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I can imagine ganun kahirap.

asr-003753
05:51:20.960 --> 05:51:23.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ang naalala ko lang teammate ko is yung former...

asr-003754
05:51:24.640 --> 05:51:26.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Executive Director natin ng NAS.

asr-003755
05:51:26.820 --> 05:51:27.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: She's from Davao.

asr-003756
05:51:28.860 --> 05:51:32.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pinakamalayo nun aside from her was Mulacan.

asr-003757
05:51:32.620 --> 05:51:34.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then all of us are from Metro Manila.

asr-003758
05:51:34.940 --> 05:51:36.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's no longer like that today.

asr-003759
05:51:37.100 --> 05:51:41.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Today, we have athletes and I'm referring to

asr-003760
05:51:41.060 --> 05:51:43.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: what I saw with my daughters who were

asr-003761
05:51:43.280 --> 05:51:48.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: university athletes also from 2012

asr-003762
05:51:48.960 --> 05:51:52.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then all the way through the pandemic.

asr-003763
05:51:52.200 --> 05:51:53.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, dalawang anak ko yun.

asr-003764
05:51:53.620 --> 05:51:54.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And yun, karamihan...

asr-003765
05:51:54.640 --> 05:51:56.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I would say half-half.

asr-003766
05:51:57.460 --> 05:52:00.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Metro Manila and then all over the country na.

asr-003767
05:52:01.460 --> 05:52:03.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Visayas and Mindanao.

asr-003768
05:52:03.460 --> 05:52:05.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, meaning may magaganda na rin

asr-003769
05:52:05.580 --> 05:52:07.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: grassroot program sa province

asr-003770
05:52:07.380 --> 05:52:12.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and the opportunity to get to the highest level of competition

asr-003771
05:52:12.660 --> 05:52:15.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which tends to be in Metro Manila for some sports,

asr-003772
05:52:15.100 --> 05:52:15.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: not for all.

asr-003773
05:52:16.160 --> 05:52:17.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But like for women's football,

asr-003774
05:52:18.000 --> 05:52:19.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's really Metro Manila.

asr-003775
05:52:19.040 --> 05:52:23.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, yung magagaling na players from Iloilo, Bacolod,

asr-003776
05:52:24.020 --> 05:52:24.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sampabagal,

asr-003777
05:52:24.640 --> 05:52:25.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pa rin yung iba sa kanila.

asr-003778
05:52:25.920 --> 05:52:27.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Marami kasi dun sa lugar na yun, eh.

asr-003779
05:52:27.800 --> 05:52:28.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Negros.

asr-003780
05:52:29.220 --> 05:52:30.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pupunta ng Manila.

asr-003781
05:52:30.660 --> 05:52:30.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay?

asr-003782
05:52:31.100 --> 05:52:32.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, and then at that time,

asr-003783
05:52:32.740 --> 05:52:34.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because ginanahan ako watching my daughters

asr-003784
05:52:34.680 --> 05:52:35.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and their teammates play,

asr-003785
05:52:36.200 --> 05:52:38.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I came up with my Pinay in Action Cup

asr-003786
05:52:38.320 --> 05:52:42.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which I purposely chose to hold

asr-003787
05:52:42.060 --> 05:52:44.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: always in the Visayas and Mindanao

asr-003788
05:52:44.260 --> 05:52:46.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because nga, less ang opportunity

asr-003789
05:52:46.480 --> 05:52:49.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for tournaments for the girls there.

asr-003790
05:52:49.980 --> 05:52:51.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, we need more of this.

asr-003791
05:52:51.560 --> 05:52:52.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm preaching to the choir

asr-003792
05:52:52.840 --> 05:52:54.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because alam ko lahat naman kayo,

asr-003793
05:52:54.640 --> 05:52:55.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: gusto nyo yan.

asr-003794
05:52:56.220 --> 05:52:58.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's really, I think,

asr-003795
05:52:58.360 --> 05:53:00.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I guess, Mr. Chairman, Mr. President,

asr-003796
05:53:00.780 --> 05:53:03.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung siguro yung, ano ko,

asr-003797
05:53:03.640 --> 05:53:08.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung gusto kong ma-achieve on this point sa grassroots

asr-003798
05:53:08.680 --> 05:53:11.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: is that all the NSAs have a plan

asr-003799
05:53:11.720 --> 05:53:13.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: on how to develop that sport

asr-003800
05:53:13.640 --> 05:53:15.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in different parts of the country.

asr-003801
05:53:16.160 --> 05:53:19.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imposible naman kasi yung all parts right away.

asr-003802
05:53:19.280 --> 05:53:19.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imposible.

asr-003803
05:53:19.800 --> 05:53:22.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I know because I'm supporting the development

asr-003804
05:53:22.580 --> 05:53:24.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of many new sports, eh.

asr-003805
05:53:24.640 --> 05:53:29.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it just so happens na I was asking my staff,

asr-003806
05:53:29.820 --> 05:53:31.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ano ba yung mga bagong sport, no?

asr-003807
05:53:31.360 --> 05:53:36.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung mga new sports that might go to the Olympics.

asr-003808
05:53:37.040 --> 05:53:38.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And interestingly, the sports that I do,

asr-003809
05:53:39.960 --> 05:53:43.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: wala akong share doon in making it an Olympic sport.

asr-003810
05:53:43.820 --> 05:53:44.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It just so happened it's a sport

asr-003811
05:53:44.960 --> 05:53:46.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that I also fell in love with.

asr-003812
05:53:46.340 --> 05:53:48.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's hybrid racing,

asr-003813
05:53:48.360 --> 05:53:50.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which the private group that does it,

asr-003814
05:53:50.040 --> 05:53:51.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's called High Rocks,

asr-003815
05:53:51.380 --> 05:53:54.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but the official description of the sport is,

asr-003816
05:53:54.300 --> 05:53:55.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's hybrid racing,

asr-003817
05:53:55.320 --> 05:53:59.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which combines running and strength stations.

asr-003818
05:54:00.680 --> 05:54:01.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the other one is paddle,

asr-003819
05:54:02.240 --> 05:54:03.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which I also play.

asr-003820
05:54:03.560 --> 05:54:04.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I think pickleball also.

asr-003821
05:54:04.940 --> 05:54:06.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Medyo mas malayo si pickleball,

asr-003822
05:54:06.200 --> 05:54:08.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: wala pa akong nababalitaan na mag-olympics yun.

asr-003823
05:54:08.100 --> 05:54:11.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But for paddle and hybrid racing,

asr-003824
05:54:11.840 --> 05:54:14.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: there's a big chance it will be in,

asr-003825
05:54:14.740 --> 05:54:18.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: not naman LA, pero the succeeding ones.

asr-003826
05:54:18.040 --> 05:54:19.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, my point is,

asr-003827
05:54:19.680 --> 05:54:21.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: hindi mo naman ma-expect na lahat yan

asr-003828
05:54:21.400 --> 05:54:24.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: have grassroots exposure,

asr-003829
05:54:24.300 --> 05:54:25.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: or all over the country.

asr-003830
05:54:25.520 --> 05:54:27.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But you must have grassroots somewhere.

asr-003831
05:54:28.200 --> 05:54:29.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ayoko nung elite sport lang siya.

asr-003832
05:54:30.160 --> 05:54:31.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, my dream is,

asr-003833
05:54:32.280 --> 05:54:34.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kung ano yung accessible sa mayaman,

asr-003834
05:54:34.340 --> 05:54:35.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: dapat accessible din

asr-003835
05:54:35.580 --> 05:54:40.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: dun sa less fortunate in financial upbringing.

asr-003836
05:54:40.920 --> 05:54:42.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, yun lang naman.

asr-003837
05:54:42.920 --> 05:54:44.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm parking that.

asr-003838
05:54:45.300 --> 05:54:47.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I can go on to my next,

asr-003839
05:54:47.320 --> 05:54:49.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: unless the chairman wants to give a quick response to that.

asr-003840
05:54:50.060 --> 05:54:51.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's not required.

asr-003841
05:54:51.820 --> 05:54:53.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm happy enough that the

asr-003842
05:54:53.320 --> 05:54:55.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: commissioners are here

asr-003843
05:54:55.040 --> 05:54:57.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: listening to my concerns.

asr-003844
05:54:57.820 --> 05:55:01.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: My next item is equal prices for women.

asr-003845
05:55:01.840 --> 05:55:04.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, we've talked about this with Commissioner Bongko.

asr-003846
05:55:04.640 --> 05:55:05.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And sabi nga niya,

asr-003847
05:55:05.880 --> 05:55:07.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pati dun sa sport niya, no,

asr-003848
05:55:07.420 --> 05:55:08.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pati sa bowling,

asr-003849
05:55:08.980 --> 05:55:10.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nagiging issue din yun.

asr-003850
05:55:10.400 --> 05:55:11.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And normally, it's because

asr-003851
05:55:11.640 --> 05:55:13.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: less ang idadahilan ng mga organizers.

asr-003852
05:55:14.260 --> 05:55:15.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Less kasi yung participants.

asr-003853
05:55:15.560 --> 05:55:18.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's a chicken and egg situation.

asr-003854
05:55:18.540 --> 05:55:19.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hindi rin gaganahan.

asr-003855
05:55:20.000 --> 05:55:20.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung mga lalaki,

asr-003856
05:55:20.880 --> 05:55:22.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: siguro na-encourage din ng pen.

asr-003857
05:55:22.440 --> 05:55:22.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sige, sige.

asr-003858
05:55:23.320 --> 05:55:24.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: May kita ka dyan,

asr-003859
05:55:24.160 --> 05:55:24.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pumasok ka dyan.

asr-003860
05:55:24.860 --> 05:55:25.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung babae naman,

asr-003861
05:55:25.560 --> 05:55:26.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: wag na, wala kang kita dyan.

asr-003862
05:55:26.740 --> 05:55:27.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's a chicken and an egg.

asr-003863
05:55:27.820 --> 05:55:29.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's why the Magna Carta of Women

asr-003864
05:55:29.420 --> 05:55:31.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: require that there's equal sports.

asr-003865
05:55:32.080 --> 05:55:33.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I have a list of

asr-003866
05:55:33.760 --> 05:55:36.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: medyo well-known tournaments

asr-003867
05:55:36.440 --> 05:55:38.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na hindi pa nga nag-comply.

asr-003868
05:55:38.960 --> 05:55:40.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, how do we do that?

asr-003869
05:55:40.300 --> 05:55:42.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ako kasi, I insist on it.

asr-003870
05:55:42.380 --> 05:55:43.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi the girls, the women,

asr-003871
05:55:43.840 --> 05:55:46.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: work just as hard to get there.

asr-003872
05:55:46.740 --> 05:55:47.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Even if sabihin na,

asr-003873
05:55:47.760 --> 05:55:49.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: oh, 20 kasi yung teams

asr-003874
05:55:49.320 --> 05:55:50.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na nag-participate sa men.

asr-003875
05:55:50.660 --> 05:55:51.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sa women kasi, apat lang.

asr-003876
05:55:52.080 --> 05:55:53.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O, ba't hindi ba naghirap yung apat?

asr-003877
05:55:53.320 --> 05:55:53.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Apat na yun.

asr-003878
05:55:54.420 --> 05:55:54.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ba, di ba,

asr-003879
05:55:54.920 --> 05:55:56.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nagsakripisyo yan?

asr-003880
05:55:56.680 --> 05:55:58.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pag yung sa elite na elite level nga,

asr-003881
05:55:58.260 --> 05:55:58.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung iba dyan,

asr-003882
05:55:58.780 --> 05:56:00.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: mag-LOA pa sa school.

asr-003883
05:56:00.320 --> 05:56:00.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ay, ba't hindi ba

asr-003884
05:56:00.800 --> 05:56:02.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nag-LOA din yung batang yan?

asr-003885
05:56:02.560 --> 05:56:03.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O, hindi ba,

asr-003886
05:56:03.160 --> 05:56:04.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nagkanda puyat-puyat din naman yan

asr-003887
05:56:04.660 --> 05:56:07.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: para ma-submit na yung mga assignment niya

asr-003888
05:56:07.480 --> 05:56:09.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: at makapag-practice pa rin.

asr-003889
05:56:09.960 --> 05:56:11.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, that's in the law.

asr-003890
05:56:11.420 --> 05:56:12.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, that's another issue.

asr-003891
05:56:12.560 --> 05:56:13.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm parking it lang

asr-003892
05:56:13.400 --> 05:56:14.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi I already had this discussion

asr-003893
05:56:14.560 --> 05:56:16.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with Commissioner Bongko.

asr-003894
05:56:16.960 --> 05:56:17.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam na, alam niya yan.

asr-003895
05:56:18.400 --> 05:56:19.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How do we just get people

asr-003896
05:56:19.900 --> 05:56:21.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: more on board on this?

asr-003897
05:56:21.680 --> 05:56:22.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then, my third

asr-003898
05:56:22.740 --> 05:56:23.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: is

asr-003899
05:56:23.400 --> 05:56:37.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, yung third ko,

asr-003900
05:56:37.900 --> 05:56:39.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I just had to double-check

asr-003901
05:56:39.160 --> 05:56:40.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with my staff on the status.

asr-003902
05:56:40.560 --> 05:56:42.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The Senate already passed our bill

asr-003903
05:56:42.860 --> 05:56:44.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: increasing the incentives

asr-003904
05:56:44.560 --> 05:56:45.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for national athletes.

asr-003905
05:56:46.260 --> 05:56:48.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, can I ask for your...

asr-003906
05:56:52.740 --> 05:57:01.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, we increased the incentives

asr-003907
05:57:01.180 --> 05:57:02.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of the athletes

asr-003908
05:57:02.200 --> 05:57:04.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then we're equalizing

asr-003909
05:57:04.180 --> 05:57:06.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: those for the para-athletes.

asr-003910
05:57:06.820 --> 05:57:07.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero baka you can help

asr-003911
05:57:07.880 --> 05:57:09.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: lobby in the house

asr-003912
05:57:09.000 --> 05:57:11.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi sa amin pumasa na.

asr-003913
05:57:11.560 --> 05:57:12.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sa house pa ang hindi.

asr-003914
05:57:13.440 --> 05:57:15.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sana mapasa naman natin to very soon

asr-003915
05:57:15.380 --> 05:57:17.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi dami rin nagaantay

asr-003916
05:57:17.180 --> 05:57:18.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: nito, diba?

asr-003917
05:57:18.460 --> 05:57:21.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mean, yung allowance ng athletes natin

asr-003918
05:57:21.420 --> 05:57:22.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: napakaliit pa.

asr-003919
05:57:22.700 --> 05:57:24.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And maybe, I don't know

asr-003920
05:57:24.940 --> 05:57:26.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: if there's time for this budget.

asr-003921
05:57:26.640 --> 05:57:27.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Baka wala.

asr-003922
05:57:27.320 --> 05:57:28.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero i-review naman natin

asr-003923
05:57:28.940 --> 05:57:31.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi I'm also familiar

asr-003924
05:57:31.360 --> 05:57:35.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: with what the allowance is.

asr-003925
05:57:35.500 --> 05:57:39.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And it's barely over minimum wage, no?

asr-003926
05:57:40.040 --> 05:57:42.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it doesn't...

asr-003927
05:57:42.400 --> 05:57:44.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, if you graduated from college,

asr-003928
05:57:44.960 --> 05:57:45.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: baka sabihin ng tatay mo,

asr-003929
05:57:46.000 --> 05:57:46.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: huwag ka na mag-sports

asr-003930
05:57:46.760 --> 05:57:48.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: kasi yung kikitain mo lang dyan

asr-003931
05:57:48.680 --> 05:57:49.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sa national team,

asr-003932
05:57:49.640 --> 05:57:51.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: pangtawid-gutom mo lang yun, eh.

asr-003933
05:57:51.200 --> 05:57:52.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Literally, for food,

asr-003934
05:57:52.400 --> 05:57:55.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: maybe for a few supplements

asr-003935
05:57:55.340 --> 05:57:56.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and that's it.

asr-003936
05:57:56.360 --> 05:57:57.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, let's review it.

asr-003937
05:57:57.740 --> 05:57:59.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Let's let the Filipino...

asr-003938
05:57:59.340 --> 05:58:00.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It should be made public,

asr-003939
05:58:01.060 --> 05:58:01.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung wish list nyo.

asr-003940
05:58:02.400 --> 05:58:03.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We should make it public

asr-003941
05:58:03.760 --> 05:58:05.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: so that the Filipinos know

asr-003942
05:58:05.480 --> 05:58:07.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that we're aware

asr-003943
05:58:07.080 --> 05:58:08.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and you're fighting for it.

asr-003944
