Senator Joel Villanueva: yun. So, again,

asr-004775
06:29:50.940 --> 06:29:52.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: just a policy

asr-004776
06:29:52.660 --> 06:29:54.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: question, what do we look?

asr-004777
06:29:54.760 --> 06:29:56.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: On these particular

asr-004778
06:29:56.480 --> 06:29:58.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: cases and incidents, and how

asr-004779
06:29:58.600 --> 06:29:59.580
