asr-004782
06:30:14.060 --> 06:30:18.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat, Senator Joel. I totally agree with you.

asr-004783
06:30:18.180 --> 06:30:23.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I am with you dito po sa ating laban kontra sa game fixing

asr-004784
