Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya tayo nanonood ng basketball or anumang sports,

asr-004788
06:30:46.220 --> 06:30:50.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: parang dyan yung thrill, ang sarap mapanood, lalong-lalo na maganda yung laban.

asr-004789
06:30:50.700 --> 06:30:55.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit nga dito sa Senado, kahit na talo na yung laro,

asr-004790
