Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya ho, laging talo yung Senado dahil dyan kay Nabea.

asr-004793
06:31:09.260 --> 06:31:09.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Oo.

asr-004794
06:31:10.080 --> 06:31:11.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Na, biro lang po, biro lang.

asr-004795
06:31:12.020 --> 06:31:12.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Andyan ho siya eh.

asr-004796
06:31:13.100 --> 06:31:17.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka pangalanan natin sila sa resolution natin yung mga players.

asr-004797
06:31:17.940 --> 06:31:25.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, ibig sabihin, ganun lang po, ganun ka-passionate yung mga players natin dito sa Senado

asr-004798
06:31:25.200 --> 06:31:28.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na kahit natalo na, lumalaban pa rin until last minute.

asr-004799
06:31:29.520 --> 06:31:36.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At malay mo, makatsamba pa, kahit na lamang ng anim, last one minute, try pa rin gumabol.

asr-004800
06:31:36.180 --> 06:31:43.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lumalaban talaga, never say die itong Senate Sentinels, led by our Senator Joel Villanueva.

asr-004801
06:31:44.040 --> 06:31:45.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, going back to your question,

asr-004802
06:31:46.120 --> 06:31:57.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the Gab has tasked with investigating alleged game-fixing and other irregularities in Philippine sports under its jurisdiction.

asr-004803
06:31:57.380 --> 06:31:59.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: However, complex game-fixing.

asr-004804
06:31:59.520 --> 06:32:07.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Game-fixing cases, particularly those involved online betting, digital transactions, and cyber-related activities,

asr-004805
06:32:08.400 --> 06:32:13.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: may require specialized technical expertise and investigative resources.

asr-004806
06:32:13.780 --> 06:32:19.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: To address this, kaya sinabi ko sa Gab ngayon, please coordinate with the PNP.

asr-004807
06:32:20.000 --> 06:32:21.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sila naman po yung law enforcement arm.

asr-004808
06:32:22.960 --> 06:32:29.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: NBI, PAGCOR, and other concern agencies for technical assistance, intelligence sharing,

asr-004809
06:32:29.520 --> 06:32:32.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and appropriate investigative and enforcement action.

asr-004810
06:32:32.860 --> 06:32:34.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gawin niyo po ang lahat.

asr-004811
06:32:34.380 --> 06:32:37.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Being a lawyer also, chairperson, pwede niyo naman po i-coordinate yan.

asr-004812
06:32:38.200 --> 06:32:44.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil under po ito ng inyong jurisdiction na po, lalong-lalo na yung game-fixing.

asr-004813
06:32:44.220 --> 06:32:47.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since sabi niyo, nare-rebalk niyo lang po ang kanilang licenses,

asr-004814
06:32:47.960 --> 06:32:51.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: but yung criminal charges ay hindi niyo na po napapalawak.

asr-004815
06:32:51.440 --> 06:32:57.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil since maaring hindi niyo na-establish po yung game-fixing.

asr-004816
06:32:57.120 --> 06:32:59.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But you can do it with coordination.

asr-004817
06:32:59.520 --> 06:33:01.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mga law enforcement agencies.

asr-004818
06:33:01.880 --> 06:33:04.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, about the other question a while ago.

asr-004819
06:33:05.680 --> 06:33:13.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bacolod was removed from the season by MPBL after the Abra game, according to our Gab chairperson.

asr-004820
06:33:13.580 --> 06:33:15.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you for that, Mr. President.

asr-004821
06:33:15.380 --> 06:33:22.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: But again, that's the league's decision, which is very commendable.

asr-004822
06:33:22.420 --> 06:33:29.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: But I think Gab should do something talaga and needs to step up its game when it comes to game-fixing.

asr-004823
06:33:29.520 --> 06:33:37.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Perhaps a mechanism that you can develop to look into this.

asr-004824
06:33:38.340 --> 06:33:44.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Perhaps, siguro yung coordination with other agencies of the government, as made mentioned by our chair.

asr-004825
06:33:45.680 --> 06:33:54.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang isang pwede siguro i-suggest, like sa Pagcor, meron sila yung mga nag-fix dun sa mga casinos, diba?

asr-004826
06:33:54.240 --> 06:33:54.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Meron sila nun.

asr-004827
06:33:54.920 --> 06:33:58.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Although, I abhor gambling institutions.

asr-004828
06:33:59.520 --> 06:34:12.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: But yung mga suspicious betting, possible game-fixing, I'm sure meron silang na-develop dyan na programa na maaari po rin yung tignan.

asr-004829
06:34:12.140 --> 06:34:21.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: So that it would be easier when to alert everyone, the public, the league itself.

asr-004830
06:34:21.440 --> 06:34:29.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: And when an alert is raised or a player reports suspected of wrongdoing,

asr-004831
06:34:29.520 --> 06:34:35.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: or merong mga action na ginagawa para magbenta ng laro,

asr-004832
06:34:36.060 --> 06:34:42.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: papaano yung gagawin natin, papaano yung mga step-by-step na procedures na gagawin natin.

asr-004833
06:34:43.160 --> 06:34:45.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: So I hope maka-develop po tayong ganyan.

asr-004834
06:34:45.440 --> 06:34:57.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I will go now to another issue, hindi lang sa another agency, which is the Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-004835
06:34:57.820 --> 06:34:59.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi kayo yung dyan naman.

asr-004836
06:34:59.520 --> 06:35:03.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pag hindi professional, madami pa rin pong ganyan.

asr-004837
06:35:03.440 --> 06:35:04.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: May mga game-fixing din po.

asr-004838
06:35:05.020 --> 06:35:07.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: May mga point-shaving, etc.

asr-004839
06:35:08.460 --> 06:35:10.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Meron po tayong nakita sa YouTube.

asr-004840
06:35:11.140 --> 06:35:11.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nanalo sila.

asr-004841
06:35:12.120 --> 06:35:13.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Galit na galit yung manager.

asr-004842
06:35:13.700 --> 06:35:14.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nagwawala.

asr-004843
06:35:14.980 --> 06:35:20.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi pala, sinyut pa nung isang player, nasira yung shaving ng points.

asr-004844
06:35:21.040 --> 06:35:22.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: So galit na galit po.

asr-004845
06:35:22.120 --> 06:35:23.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero panalo po sila.

asr-004846
06:35:23.320 --> 06:35:24.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nagsisiyan, nagsusuntukan.

asr-004847
06:35:25.420 --> 06:35:26.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nanalo po sila.

asr-004848
06:35:26.420 --> 06:35:29.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: So napakapangit po sa sports niyan.

asr-004849
06:35:29.520 --> 06:35:34.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Marami po tayo dito sa Senado na sports aficionado.

asr-004850
06:35:35.140 --> 06:35:36.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sinisira po niyan yung sports.

asr-004851
06:35:36.820 --> 06:35:39.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung huling na lang po na itatanong ko sa Gab.

asr-004852
06:35:39.860 --> 06:35:48.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Continuous po ba yung ginagawaan yung random drug testing sa mga professional athletes natin, Mr. President?

asr-004853
06:35:50.960 --> 06:35:54.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yes, ginagawa po nila yung random drug testing.

asr-004854
06:35:54.100 --> 06:35:55.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: How do you do that?

asr-004855
06:35:56.460 --> 06:35:59.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tatawagan nyo, kunyari sa PBA, tatawagan nyo yung team.

asr-004856
06:35:59.520 --> 06:36:04.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sabihin nyo, o kayo ang susunod na drug testing next week.

asr-004857
06:36:05.080 --> 06:36:05.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kayo ho.

asr-004858
06:36:05.820 --> 06:36:07.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ganun ho ba yun, sir?

asr-004859
06:36:12.120 --> 06:36:15.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ganun din sa ibang sports, Mr. President.

asr-004860
06:36:16.560 --> 06:36:17.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tatawagan yung team.

asr-004861
06:36:17.840 --> 06:36:21.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala raw pong specific dates.

asr-004862
06:36:21.500 --> 06:36:23.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But they do random testing.

asr-004863
06:36:24.020 --> 06:36:26.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: During practice, pinupuntahan raw po nila.

asr-004864
06:36:26.740 --> 06:36:27.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit na sa PBA, ginagawa po nila.

asr-004865
06:36:27.860 --> 06:36:28.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Or during games?

asr-004866
06:36:28.640 --> 06:36:28.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yes.

asr-004867
06:36:29.520 --> 06:36:39.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Actually nga raw, sabi niya, nagreklamo raw po ang PBA dahil naging intrusive na raw po sila.

asr-004868
06:36:39.820 --> 06:36:44.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi during practice, pinupuntahan nila for random testing.

asr-004869
06:36:45.060 --> 06:36:46.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But tama po yun.

asr-004870
06:36:46.320 --> 06:36:48.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gawin nyo lang po ang inyong trabaho.

asr-004871
06:36:48.780 --> 06:36:57.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung nagagawa nyo po ito, yung random testing about itong drug testing, drug test,

asr-004872
06:36:57.640 --> 06:36:59.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pakiusap ko lang po sa inyo.

asr-004873
06:36:59.520 --> 06:37:03.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So intensify nyo po itong campaign ninyo against game fixing.

asr-004874
06:37:03.540 --> 06:37:06.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Trabaho nyo po ito to stop game fixing.

asr-004875
06:37:07.060 --> 06:37:10.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At pangalawa, nandiyan dyan kasi yung game fixing pag merong mga betting.

asr-004876
06:37:12.360 --> 06:37:19.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So come up with the mechanism na ma-detect nyo, ma-stop po itong game fixing.

asr-004877
06:37:19.860 --> 06:37:22.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil nawawala yung sports.

asr-004878
06:37:22.280 --> 06:37:24.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya nga sports, sportsmanship.

asr-004879
06:37:25.120 --> 06:37:27.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nawawala yung sports pag nahaluan na ng game fixing.

asr-004880
06:37:27.980 --> 06:37:28.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala nang gana.

asr-004881
06:37:29.520 --> 06:37:31.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So wala nang thrill.

asr-004882
06:37:31.180 --> 06:37:31.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala na lahat.

asr-004883
06:37:31.800 --> 06:37:32.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nawawala.

asr-004884
06:37:33.080 --> 06:37:35.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So anyway, I'm urging you.

asr-004885
06:37:35.520 --> 06:37:38.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And nakikiusap po tayo sa inyo na gawan nyo po ng paraan.

asr-004886
06:37:38.900 --> 06:37:39.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: It's your job.

asr-004887
06:37:40.820 --> 06:37:42.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-004888
06:37:42.320 --> 06:37:49.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, just to put on record, magagalit sa akin yung ilang mga kakilala ho natin na nagsabi sa atin.

asr-004889
06:37:49.620 --> 06:37:53.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm not only talking about basketball here, Mr. President.

asr-004890
06:37:53.400 --> 06:37:54.760
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mga professional sports.

asr-004891
06:37:58.360 --> 06:37:59.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Especially basketball.

asr-004892
06:37:59.520 --> 06:38:01.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dahil doon ho tayo galing.

asr-004893
06:38:03.100 --> 06:38:05.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Naririnig, nagsabi mo sa akin, Mr. President.

asr-004894
06:38:06.880 --> 06:38:09.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sinasabihan kung anong team yung i-check ng GAB.

asr-004895
06:38:10.900 --> 06:38:13.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: Para doon sa random drug testing.

asr-004896
06:38:13.760 --> 06:38:18.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: I can be your state witness.

asr-004897
06:38:18.660 --> 06:38:21.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero sinasabihan po sila.

asr-004898
06:38:21.360 --> 06:38:22.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: And this is not just basketball.

asr-004899
06:38:23.500 --> 06:38:25.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Different professional sports.

asr-004900
06:38:25.520 --> 06:38:29.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: So I hope hindi naman po ganun.

asr-004901
06:38:29.260 --> 06:38:34.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Masakit po kasi bilang sportsman na makarinig po ng ganun.

asr-004902
06:38:34.480 --> 06:38:36.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: So yun naman po, ginawang Pangulo.

asr-004903
06:38:37.500 --> 06:38:41.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya ako sinasabi ito dahil since time immemorial and records will bail me out,

asr-004904
06:38:41.880 --> 06:38:46.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: I have been supporting GAB, been supporting PSC for quite a long time.

asr-004905
06:38:47.640 --> 06:38:54.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tandaan ko nga, wala hong makapagpondo ng mga gamit sa GAB, pati ambulansya.

asr-004906
06:38:54.140 --> 06:38:59.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tayo po yung nilapitan noon at tayo po yung nagpondo ng mga kailangan.

asr-004907
06:38:59.260 --> 06:39:08.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya lang pagka nakakarinig po tayo ng mga ganitong balita and itong mga balita po nating naririnig hindi po galing sa third party.

asr-004908
06:39:08.920 --> 06:39:11.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tayo po mismo bilang isang dating atleta.

asr-004909
06:39:12.100 --> 06:39:13.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tayo po mismo yung nakarinig.

asr-004910
06:39:14.100 --> 06:39:15.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tayo po mismo yung nasabihan.

asr-004911
06:39:16.560 --> 06:39:25.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: At yung nagsabi sa atin talagang siya mismo yung nakarinig at sinabihan kung kailan magkakaroon ng random drug testing.

asr-004912
06:39:25.600 --> 06:39:26.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Eh hindi na random yun.

asr-004913
06:39:26.660 --> 06:39:28.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anyway, Mr. President.

asr-004914
06:39:28.380 --> 06:39:29.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat.

asr-004915
06:39:29.260 --> 06:39:30.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sa inyong pasensya.

asr-004916
06:39:31.140 --> 06:39:35.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lalo na po sa ating chairperson na sponsor of the measure.

asr-004917
06:39:36.080 --> 06:39:46.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I will reiterate my earlier statement that I am in full support of the budget of PSC and GAB.

asr-004918
06:39:47.240 --> 06:39:53.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: And rest assured that may kakampi po kayo dito sa Senado kung ano man po yung may tutulong namin basta tama po yung inyong gagawin.

asr-004919
06:39:53.940 --> 06:39:55.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat, Ginong Pangulo.

asr-004920
06:39:55.320 --> 06:39:56.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004921
06:39:56.160 --> 06:39:59.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat, Senator Joel, sa suporta mo sa Pilipinas.

asr-004922
06:39:59.260 --> 06:40:03.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In sports, Senator Mig Subiri, sa suporta mo sa sports.

asr-004923
06:40:03.240 --> 06:40:06.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And kay Senator Pia, sa suporta sa sports.

asr-004924
06:40:06.440 --> 06:40:09.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And of course, ating Senate President, sa suporta sa sports.

asr-004925
06:40:10.140 --> 06:40:13.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At suportahan mo rin po yung mga athletes dito sa Senado.

asr-004926
06:40:14.280 --> 06:40:18.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba, maraming mga players na tina-employado dyan.

asr-004927
06:40:18.740 --> 06:40:20.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kailangan nila ng suporta.

asr-004928
06:40:20.460 --> 06:40:24.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi lang po sa basketball, pati sa volleyball, pickleball.

asr-004929
06:40:24.940 --> 06:40:26.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka matulungan nyo rin po.

asr-004930
06:40:26.540 --> 06:40:28.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, maraming salamat.

asr-004931
06:40:28.160 --> 06:40:28.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming salamat.

asr-004932
06:40:29.260 --> 06:40:35.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa GAB, please take note, lalong-lalo na po yung sasinabi na random drug testing.

asr-004933
06:40:35.780 --> 06:40:37.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat random nga eh.

asr-004934
06:40:37.100 --> 06:40:37.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin ng random.

asr-004935
06:40:38.120 --> 06:40:38.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi nila alam.

asr-004936
06:40:39.300 --> 06:40:41.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So gawin nyo lang po ang inyong trabaho.

asr-004937
06:40:41.420 --> 06:40:44.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At salamat sa inyong servisyo sa bayan.

asr-004938
06:40:44.700 --> 06:40:46.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa GAB and sa PSC family.

asr-004939
06:40:46.680 --> 06:40:47.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004940
06:40:47.620 --> 06:40:49.180
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Full support tayo sa sports.

asr-004941
06:40:49.280 --> 06:40:49.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Salamat.

asr-004942
06:40:50.220 --> 06:40:52.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President, ano lang.

asr-004943
06:40:53.360 --> 06:40:58.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Before we submit the budget for approval,

asr-004944
06:40:58.440 --> 06:41:05.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I'd just like to put on record na hindi pa pa natin lalagyan ng dagdag-budget ang PSC

asr-004945
06:41:05.640 --> 06:41:09.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: doon sa ating Southeast Asian Youth Games.

asr-004946
06:41:09.840 --> 06:41:14.040
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We just want to make sure na during the proper time, Mr. President,

asr-004947
06:41:14.160 --> 06:41:17.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I mentioned this to you, I mentioned this to the Finance Chair,

asr-004948
06:41:17.860 --> 06:41:21.860
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: kailangan natin dagdagan ng budget ng PSC for the Southeast Asian Youth Games.

asr-004949
06:41:22.120 --> 06:41:25.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And I believe also there's another World Championship that we're hosting.

asr-004950
06:41:27.080 --> 06:41:28.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So in the proper time,

asr-004951
06:41:28.440 --> 06:41:30.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: your honors, my dear colleagues,

asr-004952
06:41:30.740 --> 06:41:37.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I'll make a motion to amend the budget to increase the PSC for this international competition.

asr-004953
06:41:37.740 --> 06:41:38.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Tayo nagpasimuno nito.

asr-004954
06:41:38.960 --> 06:41:44.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: It's the Southeast, parang Southeast Asian Games po siya for youth, 16 and below.

asr-004955
06:41:45.280 --> 06:41:46.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Plus, yes.

asr-004956
06:41:46.960 --> 06:41:48.700
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So we can invite other countries.

asr-004957
06:41:49.280 --> 06:41:51.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So importante po yan, SP.

asr-004958
06:41:51.320 --> 06:41:52.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I mentioned that to you.

asr-004959
06:41:53.400 --> 06:41:54.020
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So yun lang.

asr-004960
06:41:54.080 --> 06:41:56.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I just want to put it on record that in the proper time,

asr-004961
06:41:56.260 --> 06:41:58.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: we will move for an additional budget.

asr-004962
06:41:58.440 --> 06:42:01.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Budget for Southeast Asian Youth Plus Games.

asr-004963
06:42:01.460 --> 06:42:03.320
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Siyempre, full support tayo sa Arnis.

asr-004964
06:42:04.000 --> 06:42:04.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yeah, dapat.

asr-004965
06:42:05.100 --> 06:42:05.420
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dapat.

asr-004966
06:42:05.500 --> 06:42:07.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kung walang Arnis doon, deupo na ako.

asr-004967
06:42:07.420 --> 06:42:07.640
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Oo.

asr-004968
06:42:07.960 --> 06:42:08.660
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Walang budget.

asr-004969
06:42:08.740 --> 06:42:09.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Hindi na natin yan.

asr-004970
06:42:10.640 --> 06:42:11.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kulang budget.

asr-004971
06:42:11.960 --> 06:42:14.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Anyway, salamat po, Mr. President.

asr-004972
06:42:14.480 --> 06:42:17.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: With that, I move that the budget of the Games and Amusement Board

asr-004973
06:42:17.980 --> 06:42:20.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and Philippine Sports Commission be deemed submitted.

asr-004974
06:42:20.940 --> 06:42:21.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I so move, Mr. President.

asr-004975
06:42:21.680 --> 06:42:23.400
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is there any objection hearing none?

asr-004976
06:42:23.400 --> 06:42:28.420
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The budgets of the Games and Amusement Board and Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-004977
06:42:28.440 --> 06:42:30.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is hereby deemed submitted.

asr-004978
06:42:30.440 --> 06:42:32.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-004979
06:42:32.440 --> 06:42:37.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And with that, I move to suspend consideration of House Bill No. 10858.

asr-004980
06:42:37.940 --> 06:42:38.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I so move.

asr-004981
06:42:38.440 --> 06:42:39.940
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Any objection hearing none?

asr-004982
06:42:39.940 --> 06:42:40.940
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The motion is approved.

asr-004983
06:42:40.940 --> 06:42:43.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President, I move that we suspend session until 10 o'clock.

asr-004984
06:42:43.940 --> 06:42:45.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Word of warning lang, sir.

asr-004985
06:42:45.940 --> 06:42:49.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Tomorrow is my Asian-Arnis Federation meeting.

asr-004986
06:42:49.940 --> 06:42:54.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I have 12, we have 12 countries tomorrow morning.

asr-004987
06:42:54.940 --> 06:42:56.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But I can be here at 1 o'clock, Mr. President.

asr-004988
06:42:56.940 --> 06:42:57.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes.

asr-004989
06:42:57.440 --> 06:42:58.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So if you can ask me.

asr-004990
06:42:58.440 --> 06:43:00.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: If you can ask Senator JV or one of the—

asr-004991
06:43:00.440 --> 06:43:01.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think Senator Riza will be—

asr-004992
06:43:01.440 --> 06:43:02.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Senator Riza, yes.

asr-004993
06:43:02.440 --> 06:43:03.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Will be sub—

asr-004994
06:43:03.440 --> 06:43:04.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Will be here.

asr-004995
06:43:04.440 --> 06:43:05.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: If she can sub for me—

asr-004996
06:43:05.440 --> 06:43:06.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Subbing for you.

asr-004997
06:43:06.440 --> 06:43:07.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Tomorrow 10 in the morning.

asr-004998
06:43:07.440 --> 06:43:13.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I move that we suspend session 10 o'clock in the morning, Friday, November 27, 2026.

asr-004999
06:43:13.440 --> 06:43:14.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I so move, Mr. President.

asr-005000
06:43:14.440 --> 06:43:16.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Any objection hearing none?

asr-005001
06:43:16.440 --> 06:43:22.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The session is suspended until 10 a.m. in the morning, Friday, November 27, 2026.

asr-005002
06:43:22.440 --> 06:43:24.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

asr-005003
06:43:24.440 --> 06:43:25.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

